WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.620
Reading for pleasure develops vocabulary and knowledge. A two-paragraph book summary

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:07.432
includes key events and a thoughtful response.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:12.785
How should a learner write a summary? Answer: Use their own words where possible.

00:00:13.617 --> 00:00:17.986
Choose an age-appropriate book; write two short summary paragraphs and recommend it

00:00:17.986 --> 00:00:19.078
to a friend.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.766
Discuss why: Paraphrasing shows understanding.
